  (text "GPIO10 HIGH asserts OLED reset; LOW releases it.\nBS1 high; BS2 low; CS# low; SA0 low => I2C 0x3C.\nD1 + D2 both connect to SDA (input + ACK output).\nThe SSD1309 is on the glass; DS1 is its 26-pad interface.\nNo RT9193-33 or TXB0108: shared I2C pull-ups are 3.0 V.\nExact panel/flex mechanics remain to be confirmed."
    (at 20.32 246.38 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.15 1.15)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid 247dc24d-b623-53ae-af79-34d57de85ef2)
  )
  (text "Sequence: logic stable -> reset pulse >=3us -> enable boost -> AFh.\nShutdown: AEh -> disable boost; keep logic powered.\nQ3 removes the boost diode feed-through path when OFF.\nDo not actively short OLED VCC/VDD to ground (SSD1309 guidance).\n12.5 V nominal; retained 1.8M/200k and 910k IREF starting values.\nFinal glass current, contrast and boost load require validation."
    (at 177.8 229.87 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.15 1.15)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid 8f7fbbbc-1fb8-5c25-9f37-817acf40a205)
  )
  (embedded_fonts no)
)
